 "text": "Hey there, how are you feeling? It' casual, yes, and nice on a nice day. Just be prepared to pay for food and kids might want more than you bargained for. You can leave early if it gets heavy. The point is enjoying the day together, and a long walk covers a lot of that anyway. Something easy to carry, like sandwiches and fruit. Water and a change of clothes are handy too. Then cancel, or turn it into an indoor movie night. A picnic in the rain is not its best self.",
